Design inspiration
------------------
Design/UX inspiration: OpenMausBot (https://github.com/milind-soni/OpenMausBot), Apache License 2.0,
Copyright its contributors. Ideas referenced: bots-as-contacts chat layout, inline tool-approval cards,
live VM screen preview captured via a shell screenshot command. No source code was copied.

